<title>HONG KONG: CL sets warrants on basket of HK property stocks.</title>
<headline>CL sets warrants on basket of HK property stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Thursday it launched 68 million American-style call warrants on a basket of Hong Kong property development stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> HKR International Ltd		 1 share</p>
<p> Huey Tai International Ltd	  1 share</p>
<p> Paliburg Holdings Ltd		 2 shares</p>
<p> Shun Tak Holdings Ltd		 2 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE   HK$29.0275	PREMIUM	  13 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE    HK$0.9562	 GEARING	  3.57</p>
<p> EXPIRATION     07.NOV.97	 PAYDATE	  25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	  HONG KONG	 LISTING DATE   27.NOV.96</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT   10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE HK$34.15</p>
<p> NOTES	    GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
